# Signing keys -- NEVER commit. The keystore in keys/ is the app's permanent
# identity on F-Droid; losing or leaking it cannot be undone.
# Note it is ignored, not untracked-by-accident: `git clean -xfd` WILL delete it.
keys/
*.jks
*.keystore

